{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-203546-r4605233","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Roast Pork Loin with Cranberry Stuffing","sourcePageId":203546,"sourceRevision":"4605233","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-12-03T21:56:43Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Roast%20Pork%20Loin%20with%20Cranberry%20Stuffing&oldid=4605233","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:46:23.524Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for stuffing and dressing","Category:Recipes using apple","Category:Recipes using cornbread","Category:Recipes using cranberry","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using fruit preserves","Category:Recipes using honey","Category:Recipes using low-moisture mozzarella","Category:Recipes using monterey jack","Category:Recipes using pepper","Category:Recipes using pork","Category:Recipes using salt","Category:Recipes using walnut","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Side dish recipes","Category:United States recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"5f8edb32b8dccd5bf6cbc74de094e955b33f4868f1e1bd18da43dc2e425f72e6","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Meat recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} \n\nThis recipe for '''roast pork loin''' is easy to follow.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 1 boneless [[Cookbook:Pork|pork]] loin roast\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* ¾ cup [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n* 2 cups hot apple [[Cookbook:Cider Vinegar|cider vinegar]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pound|pound]] ice\n* 2 cups [[Cookbook:Cornbread (disambiguation)|cornbread]], crumbled finely\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Ricotta|ricotta]] cheese\n* ¼ cup dried [[Cookbook:Cranberry|cranberries]]\n* ¾ cup apple [[Cookbook:Jelly|jelly]]\n* ½ cup dried [[Cookbook:Apple|apple]] rings, finely [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Walnut|walnuts]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] black [[Cookbook:Pepper|peppercorns]]\n* 6–8 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], smashed and [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]]\n* ½ cup shredded [[Cookbook:Mozzarella Cheese|mozzarella cheese]]\n* ½ cup shredded [[Cookbook:Monterey Jack Cheese|Monterey Jack cheese]]\n* 4 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]], beaten\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine salt, honey, vinegar, peppercorns, and garlic in a gallon size zip-top bag. Add ice and shake until ice is almost completely melted and mixture has cooled down. Add pork and refrigerate for 2½–3 hours.\n#Meanwhile, combine remaining ingredients except mozzarella and Jack cheese. Pour into a 9x9-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] [[Cookbook:Baking Pan|baking pan]] and sprinkle with remaining ingredients. [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] in the center of a 400°F [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] for 30–35 minutes or until browned and bubbly on top. Remove stuffing and keep warm.\n#Place pork roast on a roasting rack in a roasting pan and insert a probe [[Cookbook:Thermometer|thermometer]] into the center. Bake at 375°F until internal temperature reaches 140°F for medium rare. Remove to a plate and let rest 10 minutes.\n#Serve pork warm with stuffing.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using pork]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cranberry]]\n[[Category:Recipes for stuffing and dressing]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Side dish recipes]]\n[[Category:United States recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using apple]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornbread]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using walnut]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fruit preserves]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Recipes using monterey jack]]\n[[Category:Recipes using low-moisture mozzarella]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Roast Pork Loin with Cranberry Stuffing","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 boneless pork loin roast","sourceText":"1 boneless pork loin roast","amountText":"1 boneless pork loin roast","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 cup salt","sourceText":"1 cup salt","amountText":"1 cup salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"¾ cup honey","sourceText":"¾ cup honey","amountText":"¾ cup honey","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 cups hot apple cider vinegar","sourceText":"2 cups hot apple cider vinegar","amountText":"2 cups hot apple cider vinegar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 pound ice","sourceText":"1 pound ice","amountText":"1 pound ice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 cups cornbread, crumbled finely","sourceText":"2 cups cornbread, crumbled finely","amountText":"2 cups cornbread, crumbled finely","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"½ cup ricotta cheese","sourceText":"½ cup ricotta cheese","amountText":"½ cup ricotta cheese","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"¼ cup dried cranberries","sourceText":"¼ cup dried cranberries","amountText":"¼ cup dried cranberries",